   "cer:sourceText": "Have received radiotherapy within 6 months prior to the initiation of study treatment, except for palliative radiotherapy for bone disorders at least 14 days prior to initiation of study treatment; radiotherapy covering more than 30% of the bone marrow area within 28 days prior to randomization is not allowed.",
